      "content": "I hear how overwhelming that constant noise is, and it makes complete sense that seeking \"help\" feels like adding another demand to an already broken system. Often, practices like mindfulness or simply creating a safe, restful space at home can help you quiet those internal loops without needing a formal appointment. Please prioritize giving yourself permission to rest completely tonight, even if it only means closing your eyes and refusing to engage with the endless thoughts.",
